Package: vaevictis-archive-keyring
Version: 2026.10.13
Architecture: all
Maintainer: linuxtuts-website <292920559+linuxtuts-website@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://vaevictisos.org
Description: key and settings of the VaeVictis APT repository
 The public key that signs https://apt.linuxtuts.online, the source entry
 for that repository, and an apt pin that lets it provide ONLY packages
 named vaevictis-* (every other package keeps coming from Debian).
 .
 Removing this package ("apt purge vaevictis-archive-keyring") stops
 trusting the repository. A new version of this package is how a renewed
 or replaced key reaches every system.
